 cape Room created and produced by the Junior Friends of the Ephrata Public
  Library! This fundraiser benefits the Ephrata Public Library.Akron Boroug
 h is matching the funds raised to help the Jr. Friends purchase 4 new book
  carts for the Library's outside book drops. Thank you\, Akron Borough for
  your support! There are NO REFUNDS after payment. All payments are due 7 
 days before the registered Escape Room date.If under 18\, please register 
 with an adult or in a complete group of 8.  Please review the attached Esc
 ape Room policy before registering!
LOCATION:Ephrata
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/escape-library-lost-time
 -junior-friends-escape-room-169411
