DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Adults\n\nA book club for people who want to read 
 (or re-read) the classics! Our Thursday Book Group focuses on literature t
 hat has stood the test of time and continues to be relevant. New members a
 re welcome to join the discussion.2026 Reading ListJanuary 8: Billy Budd\,
  Sailor (1962 edition) by Herman MelvilleFebruary 12: Our Mutual Friend by
  Charles DickensMarch 12: The Good Soldier: A Tale of Passion Ford Maddox 
 FordApril 9: Go Down Moses by William FaulknerMay 14: The Secret History b
 y Donna TarttJune 11: It Can’t Happen Here by Sinclair LewisJuly 9: All 
