 f musical magic and sweet stories designed especially for your littlest sp
 routs. We’ll be gathered in the meeting room—just a hop\, skip\, and a
  jump across from the circulation desk.This cozy circle is tailor-made for
  tiny explorers ages 6 to 24 months. Because we want to keep things comfy 
 for everyone\, please only register your little ones in this age range. Th
 is is a special bonding time for you and your baby\, so grown-ups must sta
 y for all the fun—no drop-offs\, please!Is your little one blooming into
  a big kid? Once they hit their 2nd birthday (past 24 months)\, they’re 
 ready to join the adventure at Family Story Time! Join us there every Tues
 day at 9:30 or 10:30 for even more library fun.A quick favor: If your plan
 s change and you can't make it\, please let us know so another little frie
 nd can join the circle as this class is usually booked up fast!
LOCATION:Manheim Community\, MAN Meeting Room
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/baby-time-spring-series-
 168944
