BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dungeons and Dragons Adventure Club for Kids (Ages 9-12 only) #2
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260610T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260610T183000
UID:9c353e9c7471f98777e587b3c089ba6b@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Children\, Tweens\n\nTo ensure fair access for as man
 y families as possible\, please read the registration guidelines for this 
 program.One Session Per Month: Patrons may register for only one session o
 f this program per month.Duplicate Registrations: Registrations for more t
 han one session in the same month will be cancelled.We appreciate your und
 erstanding as we work to provide equitable access to this popular program.
 Calling all young adventurers ages 9 to 12! Join us for an exciting journe
 y into the world of Dungeons & Dragons\, where your imagination sets the c
 ourse. Together\, we’ll learn how to create unique characters\, navigate
  magical lands\, and solve thrilling quests. No prior experience is needed
 —new and experienced players alike are welcome!In each session\, you'll 
 explore stories full of mystery\, monsters\, and more all while working as
  a team to overcome challenges and puzzles. Whether you're a brave warrior
 \, a clever wizard\, or a sneaky rogue\, there’s always an adventure wai
 ting. Are you ready to roll the dice and discover where the story leads?Sp
 aces are limited\, so sign up today to secure your spot in our grand adven
 ture! All materials will be provided.Registration will open at 9:00AM on W
 ednesday\, May 27th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and o
 n Wednesday\, June 3rd for residents of other municipalities.LIBRARY PROGR
 AM POLICIES:Drop Off Program – This program is intended for children ove
 r the age of 9 years who can participate independently. Adult(s) must be p
 resent to check in child with youth services staff prior to program. Adult
 s will not be allowed in the event space. Designated Ages – Please adher
 e to the age restrictions designated on your registration. Only children i
 n that age range will be admitted.Registration Requirements – To help us
  manage our space\, please register every person who will be attending\, i
 ncluding siblings.No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration
  for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regis
 tering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please canc
 el your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program t
 o allow for those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in re
 gistration status.Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the 
 start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The pro
 gram will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot 
 will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If 
 spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, regi
 strants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the star
 t time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dungeons-and-dragons-adv
 enture-club-kids-ages-9-12-only-2-168862
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
