 ary’s Summer Reading Program is a community tradition that promotes read
 ing for fun and lifelong enrichment. This summer\, we are offering a rich 
 variety of programs to spark curiosity\, imagination\, and learning across
  all age groups.Learn just what PA looked like 400+ million years ago!Did 
 you know that Pennsylvania was once covered with a shallow body of ancient
  waters? This sea of water was teeming with life and evidence of that can 
 still be found today! See real fossils that have been found here\, and lea
 rn about our state fossil\, the trilobite. Participants will then work tog
 ether to put together a big (paper) dinosaur!Ages 5-11 · Registration req
 uired
